Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小林，过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底要犯几次同样的错？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都不是新人了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多该拿出点职业态度了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这种低级错误谁都不会犯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起\N- 你有在听吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起对不起的…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.07,0:01:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,从刚才就一直挂在嘴边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可我完全看不出你有在反省
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你那张不服气的脸\N是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,被上司说了，不是该先道歉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么不满？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是理所当然的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听懂了就回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧干活去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我会注意的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.58,0:01:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了啊你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别在意别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别往心里去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,她就那性格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不过后半段也太狠了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那种女人肯定交不到男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没戏没戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不过摘了眼镜好好化个妆的话，应该还挺好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但性格太差了，还是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,除非是那种超级抖M的家伙，不然谁受得了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,就算求我们也受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那边三个人，有什么话想对我说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不、没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有话想说就看着我的眼睛说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还有，我观察好一会儿了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,上班时间闲话也太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不、对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,回头我会全部报告给部长的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别啊，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真的对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,太可怕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,果然受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都怪你挑的头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,连我这种算M的人都觉得受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.34,0:03:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么M啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀那无所谓啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你是M？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是M啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.03,0:03:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这挺稀有的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,稀有个头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是M？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.33,0:03:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不是，男人是M很恶心的好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，挺好的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,才不好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那种肯定不受女生欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就是有点抖M而已嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是女人，也有想遵从本能去索取的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,到了夜晚，女人便化身自由的野兽，开始渴望男人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切，都是月色惹的祸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:04:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,快弄完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没，还早呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快点干啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这边一团糟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的，整理一下…\N好，搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我这边差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我干了一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,都这个点了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好好，任务达成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,收工
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦，你加油
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我会加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.38,0:05:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉，我也想帮你来着…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我先走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你也要走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:06:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，今天有点事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉啦，我先走了，辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,活干不完啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真累
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会停电？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,灯是我关的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.71,0:07:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，前辈您…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为…为什么关灯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.09,0:07:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有点活没干完
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在加班？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,大家塞了太多活给我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直觉得你老是被大家推活…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,挺可怜的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是我太好说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，前辈怎么在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉您今天跟平时不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,因为今晚是满月啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,夜里就我们两个人，总觉得有点兴奋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,前…前辈，您怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,呐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你有女朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没有，现在没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那你平时怎么解决的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这…这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来总像在憋着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没…没那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的欲望全都释放出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:09:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下前辈，大家都下班了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到你的心跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,扑通、扑通、扑通、扑通
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,越跳越快了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是已经在想接下来会发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才这么兴奋的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:10:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,扑通、扑通、扑通、扑通
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你想亲我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那，现在试试？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我想亲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有人来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,想和身为上司的我做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还想要更多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,还要更多？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你出汗了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,来，让我看看你的汗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:13:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那里真的好脏…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,出了点汗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,味道好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我超喜欢这种汗水的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,来，这只手也举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,被舔这种地方，什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,叫得好大声
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把你弄得更湿的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,脑子里只许想我一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,下面也让我好好看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看个够
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,用这条舌头狠狠侵犯你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,表情真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.74,0:15:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真色情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,味道好咸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,呐，你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我吸你乳头的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头变得好挺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,了不得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,出声吃给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.52,0:17:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你乳头很敏感呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那我再多吸一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头要不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.84,0:17:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那就不行好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好想闻遍你全身的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,味道好色情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这里味道也棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没被人舔过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我想舔遍你的全身
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股挺翘的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来，让我好好看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这里我也想舔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在在舔你的后面哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很害羞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别说出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来，再给我好好看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在抽搐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,下面是不是湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.30,0:21:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,原来你喜欢被弄这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你不也很兴奋嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.10,0:22:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不准擅自射
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.54,0:22:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,都胀得鼓鼓的了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我很容易射的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.18,0:23:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,流出来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还不能射
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.56,0:23:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,流出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.66,0:24:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快要射了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还不让你射
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.48,0:24:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,已经受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.78,0:24:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,流出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.24,0:24:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我都还没开始舔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.84,0:24:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就要射了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.34,0:24:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我生气了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.48,0:24:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.60,0:25:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,又流出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.29,0:25:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这只手
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.04,0:26:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好厉害…\N- 很厉害吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.92,0:26:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我实在受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.10,0:26:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,味道好色情
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.26,0:26:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,闷了一整天，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.72,0:27:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,混着精液的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.04,0:27:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.06,0:27:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.08,0:27:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我口活很好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.42,0:27:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,腰都浮起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.82,0:27:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.04,0:28:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这里很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.90,0:28:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,爽到不行了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.10,0:28:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.16,0:28:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,才刚碰一下就变这么大了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.34,0:28:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还不让你射
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.30,0:29:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.32,0:29:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,变得好大
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系，再大一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.18,0:29:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真是贪心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.98,0:30:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈，好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.24,0:30:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,了不得
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.94,0:30:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,后面还有好多好玩的…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.50,0:30:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不能射哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.28,0:30:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你更爽的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.38,0:30:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还要
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.76,0:31:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,仰面躺下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,躺下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.62,0:31:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.28,0:31:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,来，把膝盖弯起来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.54,0:31:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,躺好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.24,0:31:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.82,0:31:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好好看着
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.42,0:31:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,都透了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.28,0:31:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你想舔这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.40,0:31:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想舔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.12,0:32:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,过来舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不过在那之前，我想先闻闻前辈的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.24,0:32:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真变态
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.06,0:32:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.58,0:32:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真的对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.36,0:33:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,超级舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.12,0:33:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,都流了好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.14,0:33:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一边撸一边舔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.16,0:33:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.86,0:33:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一边撸
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.98,0:34:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.76,0:34:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再深一点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.76,0:34:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.58,0:34:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,舌头挺灵巧的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.70,0:34:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.98,0:34:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,脑子都要坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.48,0:35:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,可以继续舔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.14,0:35:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那，你自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.92,0:35:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把它插进去试试
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.28,0:35:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗，前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.72,0:35:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.70,0:35:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.44,0:35:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.42,0:35:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,再猛一点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.86,0:36:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,做得到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.78,0:36:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.72,0:36:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,给我再猛点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.16,0:37:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,超爽
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.16,0:37:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服，太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.62,0:37:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的东西棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.00,0:37:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.98,0:37:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.00,0:37:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再往深处试试
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.13,0:38:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,安静点就没事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.60,0:38:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.82,0:38:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,给我忍着
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.24,0:38:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你从刚才就一直在叫出声
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.08,0:38:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不过没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.96,0:38:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,来，继续
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.62,0:38:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,超爽
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.90,0:39:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在我高潮之前，继续动腰
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.46,0:39:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.16,0:39:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来得插得更深才行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.80,0:39:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢插到最深处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.16,0:39:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,完全插到底也可以？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.52,0:39:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.06,0:40:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.06,0:40:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.70,0:40:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,上司的感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.49,0:40:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.16,0:40:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.66,0:41:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,腰再动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.12,0:41:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,给我动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.96,0:41:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,插到底？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.74,0:41:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.13,0:41:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,继续动腰
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.60,0:42:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,来，让我看看插进去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.02,0:42:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一直插到最深处
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.84,0:42:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看得一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.20,0:42:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好好看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.06,0:43:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,噗嗤噗嗤地插进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.74,0:43:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,下属的东西太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.78,0:43:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,超爽
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.28,0:44:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易就进去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.40,0:44:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,坐到那里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.52,0:44:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好好坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.36,0:44:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,可以多摸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.90,0:44:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,很暖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.54,0:44:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,来，这里也要摸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.12,0:44:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是想舔了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.14,0:45:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.26,0:45:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,多舔舔上司的胸
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.06,0:45:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我舔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.84,0:45:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,下属的东西最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.32,0:45:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.90,0:46:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈里面越来越爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.12,0:46:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为真的好舒服嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.88,0:46:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.52,0:47:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你动得好猛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.76,0:47:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,果然我让你很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.09,0:47:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,非常舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.88,0:47:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,去宽敞点的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.07,0:47:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,宽敞的地方，知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.26,0:47:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里做？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.38,0:48:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽，好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.20,0:49:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,来，把你的口水给我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.38,0:50:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再多给我些口水
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.16,0:50:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可以喝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.48,0:50:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,喝下去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.35,0:50:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我的口水
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.36,0:50:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.84,0:51:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这样感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.42,0:51:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,比刚才插得更顺了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.15,0:52:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这根太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.52,0:52:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.34,0:52:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在最深处噗嗤噗嗤的好深
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.48,0:52:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.98,0:53:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我把内衣解开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.18,0:54:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,呐，我可以放开了用力摆腰吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.40,0:54:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托您了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.30,0:54:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.07,0:54:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,尽情弄到我发抖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.64,0:54:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看得很清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.64,0:55:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在我高潮之前不会停的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.16,0:55:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.82,0:55:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我忍着
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.50,0:55:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，不许射
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.54,0:55:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在我说可以之前
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.90,0:56:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒先去了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.64,0:56:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我来动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.04,0:57:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经到极限了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.36,0:57:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好了，射吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.10,0:57:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,射在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.02,0:57:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.02,0:57:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.96,0:58:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害，托前辈的福射了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.14,0:58:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,到极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.90,0:58:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.40,0:58:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你还能再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.66,0:58:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还能再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.18,0:58:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给我冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.70,0:58:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,射吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.76,0:58:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.18,0:58:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.80,0:59:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.46,0:59:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,给我再射一次
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.42,0:59:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好了，可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.10,1:00:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,射在我胸上
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.42,1:00:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,也让我尝一口
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.16,1:00:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好了，够了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.50,1:01:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,太猛了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.99,1:01:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好像要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.36,1:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,太猛了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.12,1:01:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.10,1:01:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,放松
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.28,1:01:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,放松
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.66,1:02:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好，出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.38,1:02:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,满是精液的味道，真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.16,1:03:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好，走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.58,1:03:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,满月之日我会等你的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.28,1:03:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,来，多喝点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.15,1:03:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.15,1:03:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那我不客气了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.31,1:03:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.67,1:03:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,多喝多喝
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.68,1:03:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好，谢谢前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.27,1:03:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还要喝哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.74,1:03:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是喝太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.48,1:03:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这原酒味道也太浓了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.61,1:04:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等等等等等等
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.96,1:04:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.86,1:04:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这点应该喝得了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.60,1:04:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.02,1:04:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.69,1:04:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.85,1:04:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.20,1:04:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.90,1:04:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，看着好好喝
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.94,1:04:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来，毕竟这次是你们俩让项目大获成功
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.98,1:04:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就痛快喝一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.20,1:04:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.01,1:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,都是托我的福你们才喝得上
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.58,1:04:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.80,1:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那我喝了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.48,1:04:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不过您平时看起来那么认真严厉
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.36,1:04:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一喝酒完全不一样了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.40,1:04:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.93,1:04:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,变了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.77,1:04:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,喝醉了还挺可爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.60,1:04:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.43,1:04:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.83,1:04:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你们平时是不是觉得我是个古板的上司
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.49,1:04:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那种事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.14,1:04:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是觉得我是个无趣的女人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.30,1:05:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对没那种事
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.58,1:05:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,而且感觉和平时完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.95,1:05:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.47,1:05:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,气氛真的完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.17,1:05:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.10,1:05:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为今天没戴眼镜吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.56,1:05:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上不戴眼镜？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.14,1:05:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.54,1:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上我会换隐形
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.24,1:05:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,为了能更看清猎物
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.22,1:05:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.30,1:05:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才是不是说了猎物
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.38,1:05:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没有没有
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.77,1:05:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，那话可不能随便说
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.92,1:05:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,纱雪前辈，什么猎物啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.42,1:05:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,快喝吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.78,1:05:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.79,1:05:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.58,1:05:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不过今天真开心
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.69,1:05:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，你们俩能把项目做成太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.90,1:05:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直互相打气说要加油
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.04,1:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那是当然
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.04,1:06:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,心里一直憋着劲想干出点成绩
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.10,1:06:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,今天真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.46,1:06:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,话说，你们俩有女朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.48,1:06:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这么突然
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.17,1:06:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没、没有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.83,1:06:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.29,1:06:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.41,1:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,被这么问有点不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.54,1:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,突然问这个超不好意思的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.96,1:06:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,工作嘛，确实有点忙
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.12,1:06:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,既然是工作，以后得更认真才行哦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.19,1:06:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一定的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.46,1:06:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会加油的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.26,1:06:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.95,1:06:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我再点杯酒
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.75,1:06:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,确实喝了不少
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.48,1:06:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,居然买了这种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.10,1:06:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,话说，纱雪前辈没有男朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.58,1:06:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.28,1:06:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微透露一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.64,1:06:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.58,1:06:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,才不告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.30,1:06:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.90,1:07:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都老实回答了，太让人好奇了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.72,1:07:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉，末班车时间好像有点赶
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.66,1:07:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,到末班车时间了？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.54,1:07:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀呀
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.57,1:07:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.66,1:07:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.81,1:07:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没事没事，小林你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.51,1:07:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉，我得冲过去不然赶不上
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.88,1:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.73,1:07:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,回见啦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.40,1:07:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那我呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.63,1:07:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你嘛，会留到天亮吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.06,1:07:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.26,1:07:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来，到旁边来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.02,1:07:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,旁边？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.98,1:07:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.80,1:07:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,过来这边
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.20,1:07:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.16,1:07:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.60,1:07:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.98,1:07:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，这…怎么回事…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.47,1:07:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.23,1:07:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不…等等，前辈？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.22,1:07:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,您、您这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.48,1:08:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等等…琴音他也走了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.44,1:08:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他说要赶末班车
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.80,1:08:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还能喝吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.42,1:08:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿着呢，前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.94,1:08:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我会喝的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.91,1:08:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那就喝吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.12,1:08:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,还能喝吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.05,1:08:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我会喝的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.48,1:08:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我的…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.12,1:08:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,您怎么了，前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.62,1:08:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈，您这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.48,1:08:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,您喝醉了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.71,1:08:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我才没醉
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.44,1:08:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.98,1:09:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,等…琴音…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.52,1:09:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是在居酒屋
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.82,1:09:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,反正也没人了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.28,1:09:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不，真的不行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.04,1:09:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等等，前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.38,1:09:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只剩我们两个了…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.54,1:09:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不，等等，真的不行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.96,1:09:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你安静点的话就不会被发现
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.45,1:09:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.94,1:09:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,话说小林
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.42,1:09:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有女朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.26,1:09:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是没有，可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.94,1:10:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.74,1:10:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚我来当你的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.42,1:10:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好、好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.14,1:10:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.72,1:10:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，碰那里不行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.80,1:10:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.44,1:10:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这里很敏感？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.04,1:10:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.72,1:10:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有人来的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.96,1:10:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.15,1:10:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，那里真的不行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.40,1:10:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，你声音太大了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.34,1:10:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.40,1:10:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,会被发现的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.32,1:10:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,被发现也没关系？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.56,1:10:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不、被发现就不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.20,1:11:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,舌头再伸出来一点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.68,1:11:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是做得到嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.06,1:11:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.28,1:11:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,像在和果汁接吻一样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.76,1:11:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.64,1:11:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也是果汁
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.68,1:11:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,身体变好热
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.08,1:11:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么汁水流个不停
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.96,1:11:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不、对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.02,1:11:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你就这么渴望我？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.72,1:12:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,小林你是不是也热起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.63,1:12:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不、这…是要混着喝的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.96,1:12:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,混在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.72,1:12:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你其实一直很期待吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.09,1:12:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不…那、那是…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.08,1:12:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不、等等，真的不行
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.34,1:12:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,身体不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.08,1:12:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不、没…没那回事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.24,1:12:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,都叫出声了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.50,1:12:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.38,1:13:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你是M属性吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.56,1:13:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那是…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.32,1:13:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前倒是听过这种传闻
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.44,1:13:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.58,1:13:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.56,1:13:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.50,1:13:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你脸上写着M呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.64,1:13:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.90,1:13:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我是M
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.18,1:13:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,很诚实嘛，不错
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.90,1:13:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你想被怎么对待
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.69,1:13:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，怎么对待…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.70,1:13:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是喜欢会痛的那种
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.16,1:13:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.66,1:14:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.27,1:14:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛，两边都痛
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.56,1:14:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,两边啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.67,1:14:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.04,1:14:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但你很喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.99,1:14:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,靠到墙上
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.90,1:14:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太刺激了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.08,1:14:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,都…都立起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.60,1:14:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.69,1:14:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还没让你碰下面呢，就先摸胸了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.31,1:14:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不、不是那个意思，不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.78,1:14:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.56,1:14:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还太早了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.64,1:14:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.56,1:14:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是我在主导
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.46,1:15:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，洗一下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.28,1:15:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.22,1:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.58,1:15:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,声音太大了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.97,1:15:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.92,1:15:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你就这么没力气？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.84,1:15:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈舔得太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.48,1:15:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这边呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.60,1:15:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.45,1:15:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.08,1:16:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头变得好挺
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.56,1:16:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有点受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.50,1:16:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.74,1:16:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还觉得热？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.68,1:16:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越激烈了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.64,1:16:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.58,1:16:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,都湿透了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.32,1:17:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,知道什么叫恩威并施吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.09,1:17:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,恩威并施？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.01,1:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.72,1:17:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好凉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.72,1:17:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,太冰了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.83,1:17:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你看，下面都动了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.51,1:17:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.33,1:17:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好凉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.84,1:17:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.29,1:17:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,降温了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.22,1:17:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.39,1:17:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好凉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.86,1:18:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这就叫恩威并施
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.86,1:18:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.38,1:18:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.29,1:18:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,都变红了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.20,1:18:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,得弄暖和才行
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.52,1:18:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,暖和了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.28,1:19:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,更好吃了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.46,1:19:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,该不会下面也变大了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.89,1:19:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.24,1:19:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,兴奋了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.86,1:19:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.70,1:19:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让我看看你那根吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.82,1:19:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，这真的太危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.92,1:19:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,小林你只要不出声就不会被发现
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.82,1:20:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可是前辈弄得太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.84,1:20:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你的长什么样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.90,1:20:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抬起腿
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.10,1:20:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,都湿透了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.62,1:20:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.38,1:20:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么找借口
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.74,1:20:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到借口吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.70,1:21:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,给上司看看
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.22,1:21:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.56,1:21:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是上司命令
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.46,1:21:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是看不清嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.68,1:21:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哭成这样真可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.63,1:21:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,太丢人了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.38,1:21:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,丢人吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.84,1:21:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这里受不了了？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.12,1:21:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,都变粉了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.00,1:22:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.46,1:22:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,说，你想让我怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.48,1:22:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.02,1:22:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,流了这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.05,1:22:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.70,1:22:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.85,1:22:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,弄出那种声音会被听见的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.66,1:22:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.48,1:22:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那接下来用嘴帮你射
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.06,1:22:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.12,1:22:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.74,1:23:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你的真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.96,1:23:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对、对
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.64,1:23:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.72,1:23:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,弄这里舒服？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.90,1:23:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,龟头
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.71,1:23:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,龟头？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.10,1:23:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,舔龟头很舒服？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.50,1:23:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.46,1:23:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那就快说"请再多舔舔我"
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.64,1:23:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈，请再多舔舔
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.98,1:23:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.34,1:23:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,太猛了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.12,1:24:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.74,1:24:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌这么猛吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.94,1:24:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是讨厌…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.86,1:24:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不用忍着
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.62,1:24:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…等等，前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.12,1:24:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,变好大了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.34,1:24:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.84,1:24:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.00,1:24:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,想让我转圈？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.50,1:25:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.84,1:25:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,龟头舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.18,1:25:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.68,1:25:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.90,1:26:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,被这么弄的话
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.86,1:26:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行不行
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.44,1:26:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.36,1:26:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.98,1:26:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才要射了？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.76,1:26:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.33,1:26:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真的要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.76,1:26:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不许擅自射
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.77,1:26:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.96,1:26:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.96,1:26:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太猛了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.50,1:26:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,太刺激了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.01,1:26:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.26,1:26:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.14,1:26:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,太猛了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.28,1:26:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.06,1:26:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不许射
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.88,1:27:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还不许射
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.53,1:27:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.28,1:27:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.83,1:27:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真的要…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.28,1:27:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.74,1:27:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.32,1:27:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.30,1:27:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,擅自射了的话我可饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.80,1:27:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在给小林出道题
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.76,1:27:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,题？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.96,1:28:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.10,1:28:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,内裤？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.86,1:28:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.86,1:28:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,知道为什么会在这儿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.38,1:28:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这裙子里面
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.00,1:28:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没穿？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.32,1:28:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我没穿内裤哦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.66,1:28:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,您一直没穿？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.54,1:28:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那答对的小林有奖励
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.28,1:28:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很适合你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.28,1:28:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,太丢人了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.04,1:28:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很可爱嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.75,1:28:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很适合你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.58,1:29:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没穿内裤
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.77,1:29:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没穿哦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.16,1:29:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,兴奋了？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.78,1:29:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,当然兴奋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.26,1:29:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你还压抑什么
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.86,1:29:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那你稍微躺下点
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.10,1:29:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想让你弄舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.60,1:29:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.40,1:29:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,看，看得一清二楚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.44,1:29:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.10,1:30:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,舔我下面
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.46,1:30:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,再多舔舔
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.10,1:30:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好湿
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.30,1:30:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好湿
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.68,1:31:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,舔我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.76,1:31:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，嘴怎么停了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.48,1:31:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让你的上司高潮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.00,1:31:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,打着圈舔
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.36,1:31:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,能再张大嘴舔吗
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.24,1:32:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我湿透了的下面怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.40,1:32:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,太让人兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.64,1:32:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那就再兴奋点
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.86,1:32:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,舔我
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.77,1:32:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得做了不该做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.10,1:33:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,继续舔
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.01,1:33:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不许射
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.14,1:33:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,在我说可以之前绝不许射
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.72,1:33:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,舔我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.60,1:34:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,舔我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.06,1:34:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在我说可以之前
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.80,1:34:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.40,1:34:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,都射到嘴里了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.78,1:34:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.98,1:34:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.24,1:34:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你喝下去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.90,1:34:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.90,1:34:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到你能喝下这么多自己的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.14,1:34:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.85,1:34:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.49,1:34:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.74,1:34:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,沾到鼻子上了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.50,1:34:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,得弄干净才行
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.42,1:34:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,弄干净什么的…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.24,1:34:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.30,1:35:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,都溢出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.97,1:35:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.68,1:35:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我也兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.74,1:35:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,痒吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.28,1:35:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.40,1:35:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好痒
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.64,1:35:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说乳头很敏感嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.52,1:35:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还能再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.56,1:36:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.62,1:36:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好像又硬了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.26,1:36:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不、这是…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.82,1:36:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还能再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.65,1:36:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不、第二次…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.42,1:36:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,出汗了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.45,1:36:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.23,1:36:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.06,1:36:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头也可以摸
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.08,1:36:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你射出来
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.46,1:36:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,里面也爽得不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.40,1:37:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.96,1:37:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好好爽一爽吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.76,1:37:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.28,1:37:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.74,1:37:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,可以射吗
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.58,1:37:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.86,1:37:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可以舒服地射出来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.46,1:37:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.85,1:37:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.96,1:37:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.94,1:37:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.24,1:37:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.88,1:38:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是好好来了第二次嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.90,1:38:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,其实挺行的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.54,1:38:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事是我们两个人的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.67,1:38:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,明天还要上班，给我好好干
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.57,1:38:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我会努力的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.34,1:39:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,纱雪小姐，你结过婚吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.65,1:39:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,离过一次
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.28,1:39:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,想着要是能再结一次，住进这样的房子就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.62,1:39:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家还贷都快喘不过气了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.82,1:39:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有男朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.70,1:39:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.30,1:39:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,算是把工作当恋人了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.44,1:39:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可你这么漂亮，应该很受欢迎吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.59,1:39:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是找男朋友的条件很高啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.47,1:39:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没有没有，没那回事
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.10,1:39:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,也没什么理想型
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.02,1:39:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,硬要说的话，精力旺盛的人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.68,1:39:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,精力旺盛？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.37,1:39:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是让你误会了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.20,1:40:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说喜欢夜晚，所以想找个能一起喝酒的人
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.94,1:40:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，我好像喝多了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.46,1:40:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.31,1:40:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,再干一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.58,1:40:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,老公，来，多喝点
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.16,1:40:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,重新来，干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.24,1:40:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有什么不吃的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.72,1:40:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思，只有些家常菜
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.48,1:40:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃什么尽管说
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.28,1:40:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.90,1:40:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没事没事
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.36,1:40:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你每次都喝太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.32,1:40:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,趁没醉先吃点
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.88,1:40:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的，请用
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.28,1:40:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那我不客气了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.14,1:40:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你那么喜欢葱 的话就吃葱 的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.92,1:40:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这个点金枪鱼肚早就卖光了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.99,1:40:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,少嘴碎
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.03,1:41:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没葱 的她就不吃，这可难办了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.30,1:41:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那你吃黄瓜卷吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.33,1:41:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,做不了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.44,1:41:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,让您见笑了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.34,1:41:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.86,1:41:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,今天给你多留点黄瓜卷
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.34,1:41:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那还不够塞牙缝的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.69,1:41:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你别说了，丢人
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.44,1:41:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来想吃好的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.02,1:41:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.42,1:41:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你正经点
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.34,1:41:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.18,1:41:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这酒应该不错
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.62,1:41:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,家里没别的酒了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.13,1:41:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不是有嗨棒吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.40,1:41:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,给我来个黄瓜卷
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.92,1:42:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.68,1:42:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我太太喝醉了，给您添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.24,1:42:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,太太睡着了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.00,1:42:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,时间也不早了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.90,1:42:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,酒醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.79,1:42:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，托您的福
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.44,1:42:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,实在对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.16,1:42:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.56,1:42:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,话说梅本，你和太太没做过吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.51,1:42:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.20,1:42:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别突然问这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.51,1:42:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了很多事
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.21,1:42:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,很多事
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.86,1:42:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然会有各种事
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.93,1:43:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.54,1:43:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听刚才你们对话，感觉太太对那方面不太积极
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.62,1:43:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,给人这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.98,1:43:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.43,1:43:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.46,1:43:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也有时机什么的问题
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.62,1:43:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上到底怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.54,1:43:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你满足了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.52,1:43:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.48,1:43:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.10,1:43:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.64,1:43:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看你那表情就知道没满足
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.58,1:43:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,也没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.92,1:43:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,夫妻嘛，就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.26,1:43:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但总觉得你好可怜
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.38,1:43:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.69,1:43:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不是，前辈您今天和往常不太一样
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.48,1:43:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.90,1:43:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,您怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.28,1:43:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,您喝醉了？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.36,1:43:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没，我没醉
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.46,1:44:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一到了晚上
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.00,1:44:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一到了晚上？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.16,1:44:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,情绪就有些高涨呢
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.40,1:44:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不，您喝多了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.36,1:44:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没有没有
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.10,1:44:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你就没用色色的眼光看过我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.18,1:44:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不，怎么会，您可是我的上司
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.04,1:44:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真的没有
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.86,1:44:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想看看我真正的样子吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.16,1:44:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的样子？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.96,1:44:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.08,1:44:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.54,1:45:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我来教你
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.12,1:45:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,您在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.01,1:45:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我很为难
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.22,1:45:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,太大声太太会醒的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.04,1:45:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.60,1:45:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你不喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.33,1:45:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,被上司这样对待
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.06,1:45:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.83,1:45:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但她现在不是睡着了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.70,1:46:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这下麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.14,1:46:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,很为难呢
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.73,1:46:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你也没得到满足吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.22,1:46:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不不，那是两码事
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.08,1:46:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就让我来满足你
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.22,1:46:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.68,1:47:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.22,1:47:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.80,1:47:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的没醉吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.78,1:47:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是不了解我
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.46,1:47:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是上司命令
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.80,1:47:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,上司命令？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.02,1:47:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这么担惊受怕？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.88,1:48:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是一直用色色的眼光看你的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.90,1:48:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你没发现？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.94,1:48:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.36,1:48:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快舔
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.27,1:48:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.12,1:48:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,发现了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.29,1:48:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,发现了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.08,1:48:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,安静点
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.42,1:48:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.96,1:49:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,被这样弄觉得舒服，你该不会是M吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.93,1:49:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不、没那回事
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.48,1:49:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,只是因为舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.32,1:49:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是M？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.28,1:49:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就来教教你
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.66,1:49:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.42,1:49:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好猛
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.22,1:49:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.26,1:50:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你看，很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.26,1:50:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,被这样摸很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.70,1:50:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看，有反应了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.54,1:50:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我的乳头也有感觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.26,1:50:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你想摸摸看吗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.28,1:51:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,摸摸看
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.34,1:51:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我穿了这么性感的内衣
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.46,1:51:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不兴奋？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.38,1:51:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,兴奋是兴奋…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.57,1:51:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,来，揉一揉
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.40,1:51:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.11,1:51:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.36,1:51:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,得多用点力才行
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.84,1:52:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,呐，好像有什么一直顶着这里
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.52,1:52:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,硬了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.37,1:52:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不、没有…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.86,1:52:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,顶到了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.04,1:52:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈，不行
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.84,1:52:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那我得确认一下
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.52,1:52:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,果然，都硬成这样了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.22,1:52:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不行
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.98,1:53:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,都到这份上了还有什么不行的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.53,1:53:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不不，这样我很为难
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.44,1:53:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快脱
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.06,1:53:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.16,1:53:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.06,1:53:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不脱
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.75,1:53:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都到这步了还停什么
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.76,1:53:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可是，太太还在
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.28,1:53:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.64,1:53:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,都变这么大了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.32,1:53:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.25,1:53:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我总不能就这么放着不管吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.80,1:53:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么好害羞的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.51,1:53:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就是害羞
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.19,1:53:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,来，把腰抬起来
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.48,1:54:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,挺威风的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.92,1:54:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不，别弄得这么热
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.60,1:54:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,太太要是醒了就…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.58,1:54:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你这里很敏感吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.83,1:54:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不、没有
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.66,1:54:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.50,1:54:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.92,1:54:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你舒服舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.02,1:54:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.63,1:54:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不、那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.40,1:54:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.33,1:54:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.06,1:54:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.76,1:55:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.78,1:55:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.50,1:55:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.94,1:55:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.36,1:55:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不行？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.00,1:55:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,敢偷偷射了我可不饶你
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.36,1:55:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.45,1:55:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不行哦
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.20,1:55:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你射了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.86,1:55:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.34,1:55:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,前列腺液都流出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.90,1:55:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这么快就要射，说明你憋了很久吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.38,1:56:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没…没有…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.14,1:56:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.72,1:56:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.44,1:56:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,被这样舔很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.49,1:56:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.32,1:56:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那就这么舔一下你就会马上射吗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.50,1:56:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,色色的汁液源源不断地流出来
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.90,1:57:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就想尝尝这根了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.64,1:57:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.46,1:57:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.72,1:57:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,味道变好了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.48,1:57:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.98,1:58:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.62,1:58:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,爽得要哭了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.30,1:58:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,还不让你射
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.16,1:58:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,得让你爽得更彻底
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.96,1:58:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.64,1:58:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就是要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.62,1:58:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一起舒服到坏掉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.76,1:59:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.80,1:59:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.82,1:59:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,她没醒
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.84,1:59:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,太猛了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.48,1:59:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,猛？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.42,1:59:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,和上司做感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.16,1:59:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.02,1:59:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.22,1:59:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.60,2:00:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你太太也不经常帮你弄
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.60,2:00:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就让我代替她满足你
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.88,2:00:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.84,2:00:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还行吗
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.48,2:00:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.08,2:00:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.13,2:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.94,2:00:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，还不许射
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.54,2:00:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不行？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.52,2:00:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还不让你射
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.82,2:00:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你看看我的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.22,2:01:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你想看吧
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.32,2:01:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,都湿成这样了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.32,2:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去她会醒的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.68,2:02:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.98,2:02:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.89,2:02:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.18,2:02:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.56,2:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,难受吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.46,2:03:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来，舌头再动一动
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.70,2:03:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,爽到了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.88,2:04:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才憋得难受？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.78,2:04:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你喘得好厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.52,2:04:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.24,2:04:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经做好觉悟了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.18,2:05:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要插进来，你不插吗
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.76,2:05:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,逗你的
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.78,2:05:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在犹豫什么
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.48,2:05:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.14,2:05:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己放进来
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.50,2:05:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,做不到？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.84,2:05:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不、做得到，可是…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.84,2:06:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.06,2:06:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,能动吧
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.90,2:06:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己动
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.74,2:06:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,来，再猛点
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.36,2:06:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.96,2:06:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,里面好热
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.78,2:07:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,和你太太比怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.58,2:07:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.28,2:07:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.64,2:07:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我比你太太更棒吧
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.38,2:07:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.32,2:07:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,压低声音
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.92,2:07:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这下麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.96,2:07:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.40,2:08:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再往最深处顶\N我明白了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.58,2:08:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.50,2:08:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你挺能动的嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.20,2:08:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,再往这边坐一点
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.86,2:09:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.32,2:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,坐到这里来
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.50,2:09:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这样是不是能更深
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.04,2:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不是更容易进去嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.54,2:09:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.80,2:09:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看，很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.87,2:09:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是，很舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.42,2:09:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.54,2:10:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,插进去的地方看得一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.80,2:10:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,给我好好烙在眼里
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.34,2:10:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看，太太还在睡
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.80,2:10:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不妙
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.52,2:10:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.62,2:10:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,动起来了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.02,2:10:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们挺合得来
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.06,2:11:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,胸也再多…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.02,2:11:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吸
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.80,2:11:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N这胸
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.90,2:11:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,舔也可以
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.20,2:12:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太猛了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.38,2:12:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可还没完
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.72,2:12:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.46,2:12:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,太太看得一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.56,2:12:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.70,2:12:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,插进去的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.26,2:12:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,展示给她看
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.56,2:13:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:13:16.88,2:13:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.56,2:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在我高潮之前给我忍着
Dialogue: 0,2:14:10.82,2:14:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你也能自己动吧
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.51,2:14:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,从下面顶上来
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.88,2:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.28,2:14:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,做得到吗
Dialogue: 0,2:14:22.60,2:14:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,做得到的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.36,2:14:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.80,2:14:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是滑出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.67,2:14:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.82,2:15:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.30,2:15:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全不会动嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.25,2:15:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.94,2:15:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你想变得更舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.98,2:15:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好大的水声
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.06,2:16:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太太不是还在睡嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.68,2:16:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,会醒？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.10,2:16:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不会醒吧
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.58,2:16:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就在太太面前
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.58,2:16:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,动动腰试试
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.16,2:16:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:40.10,2:16:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,给我动起来
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.79,2:16:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.72,2:16:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.86,2:17:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.94,2:17:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,会被发现的
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.88,2:17:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道她会是什么心情
Dialogue: 0,2:17:55.38,2:17:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,非常舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.52,2:18:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,顶到更深处
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.68,2:18:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我的脚
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.34,2:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这样？
Dialogue: 0,2:18:21.49,2:18:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,山本
Dialogue: 0,2:18:23.98,2:18:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我的腿
Dialogue: 0,2:18:28.94,2:18:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这样？
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.88,2:18:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,坐到这里来
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.48,2:18:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服得快要叫出声了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.66,2:19:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.10,2:19:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在我说可以之前，一直动腰
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.01,2:19:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得到吧
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.32,2:20:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来换我动
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.70,2:20:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.58,2:20:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,里面好热
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.76,2:20:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:20:48.82,2:20:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.90,2:20:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的里面
Dialogue: 0,2:20:58.00,2:21:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,请帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.40,2:21:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,请帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,2:21:03.55,2:21:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.18,2:22:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,看好插进拔出的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.20,2:22:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看得清楚吗
Dialogue: 0,2:22:34.31,2:22:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看得见
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.18,2:22:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,给我兴奋一点
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.66,2:23:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看清楚插进去的地方了？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.34,2:23:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这还是第一次
Dialogue: 0,2:23:31.50,2:23:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,爽得受不了了
Dialogue: 0,2:23:35.82,2:23:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别说这么可怕的话
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.54,2:23:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你都不反抗了嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.20,2:23:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不、那是另一回事…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:32.18,2:24:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,被你的东西弄得又高潮了
Dialogue: 0,2:25:20.22,2:25:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:25:26.36,2:25:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:25:30.76,2:25:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:25:33.26,2:25:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.71,2:25:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,变得这么舒服了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.06,2:25:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在我说可以之前绝对不许射
Dialogue: 0,2:25:55.96,2:25:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:26:10.60,2:26:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:26:14.80,2:26:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:26:17.70,2:26:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我在稍微忍着
Dialogue: 0,2:26:21.56,2:26:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在忍着？
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.52,2:26:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不用再忍了
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.18,2:26:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来也可以
Dialogue: 0,2:26:45.98,2:26:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想射了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:26:51.20,2:26:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,往上司的里面射满精液吧
Dialogue: 0,2:27:00.48,2:27:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,全射出来
Dialogue: 0,2:27:36.42,2:27:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多
Dialogue: 0,2:27:43.56,2:27:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在这上司的里面
Dialogue: 0,2:27:51.44,2:27:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,2:27:53.76,2:27:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你的精液全都出来了
Dialogue: 0,2:27:57.46,2:27:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,全都出来了
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.48,2:28:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,来舔舔看
Dialogue: 0,2:28:00.24,2:28:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌吗
Dialogue: 0,2:28:16.70,2:28:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:28:17.45,2:28:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,自己精液的味道
Dialogue: 0,2:28:19.26,2:28:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.02,2:28:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样太浪费了
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.64,2:28:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:28:35.96,2:28:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还能动吧
Dialogue: 0,2:28:41.20,2:28:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,等着
Dialogue: 0,2:28:43.09,2:28:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,2:28:50.14,2:28:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不是还硬着嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:28:56.12,2:28:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真的要…
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.96,2:29:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,插进来
Dialogue: 0,2:29:17.82,2:29:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.60,2:29:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再动快点
Dialogue: 0,2:29:28.28,2:29:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是这里吗
Dialogue: 0,2:29:36.20,2:29:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.83,2:29:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,让我多高潮几次
Dialogue: 0,2:30:20.26,2:30:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还能动吧
Dialogue: 0,2:30:23.04,2:30:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会更努力的
Dialogue: 0,2:30:34.14,2:30:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还能动
Dialogue: 0,2:30:56.50,2:30:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:31:30.08,2:31:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你的精液
Dialogue: 0,2:31:32.76,2:31:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不光是下面
Dialogue: 0,2:31:35.94,2:31:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也射进我嘴里吧
Dialogue: 0,2:31:40.30,2:31:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴里？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:41.76,2:31:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,2:31:45.26,2:31:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴里也多射一点
Dialogue: 0,2:31:52.08,2:31:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,2:31:55.10,2:31:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,2:31:56.79,2:31:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,2:31:59.54,2:32:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,多射一点
Dialogue: 0,2:32:08.56,2:32:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,2:32:15.10,2:32:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,2:32:48.14,2:32:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事是秘密
Dialogue: 0,2:32:55.16,2:32:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,2:33:21.14,2:33:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要保密
Dialogue: 0,2:33:52.64,2:33:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.48,2:33:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也是满月呢
Dialogue: 0,2:34:04.72,2:34:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,过来这边
Dialogue: 0,2:34:09.28,2:34:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，变成这副样子了
Dialogue: 0,2:34:14.38,2:34:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,今天想让我对你做什么
Dialogue: 0,2:34:34.92,2:34:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样什么都看不懂
Dialogue: 0,2:34:50.58,2:34:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,转过去
Dialogue: 0,2:35:03.46,2:35:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么吧
Dialogue: 0,2:35:14.28,2:35:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前也是个M，所以很懂
Dialogue: 0,2:35:24.02,2:35:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,想被弄痛？
Dialogue: 0,2:35:35.28,2:35:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,来，要上了
Dialogue: 0,2:35:41.02,2:35:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.02,2:35:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:35:47.62,2:35:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可以叫大声点
Dialogue: 0,2:36:02.56,2:36:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是什么表情呢
Dialogue: 0,2:36:06.44,2:36:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,叫大声点
Dialogue: 0,2:36:16.36,2:36:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来，要上了
Dialogue: 0,2:36:26.84,2:36:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,叫大声点也没关系
Dialogue: 0,2:36:33.90,2:36:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,叫得很好听嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:36:39.80,2:36:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就看不见了
Dialogue: 0,2:36:45.54,2:36:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是什么表情呢
Dialogue: 0,2:36:51.04,2:36:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,眼神很不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:36:56.52,2:36:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还要继续哦
Dialogue: 0,2:37:00.06,2:37:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还想要更多吧
Dialogue: 0,2:37:07.44,2:37:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,给我叫大声点
Dialogue: 0,2:37:16.44,2:37:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可以叫大声点
Dialogue: 0,2:37:21.56,2:37:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,变得更舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:37:45.04,2:37:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,想叫得更大声吧
Dialogue: 0,2:37:52.76,2:37:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不拿掉这个可发不出声音
Dialogue: 0,2:37:57.30,2:38:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,口水都流成这样了
Dialogue: 0,2:38:02.10,2:38:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,2:38:15.72,2:38:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,想让我解开这个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:38:21.82,2:38:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,像小狗一样真可爱
Dialogue: 0,2:38:27.76,2:38:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,2:38:31.00,2:38:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就帮你解开吧
Dialogue: 0,2:38:33.42,2:38:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,让你能开口说话
Dialogue: 0,2:38:51.30,2:38:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:38:57.42,2:38:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也很开心呢
Dialogue: 0,2:39:22.60,2:39:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:39:23.43,2:39:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:39:25.09,2:39:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，我会让你更舒服的
Dialogue: 0,2:39:29.70,2:39:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,躺到这里来
Dialogue: 0,2:39:37.44,2:39:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这里吗
Dialogue: 0,2:39:57.50,2:40:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的话必须绝对服从
Dialogue: 0,2:40:00.20,2:40:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是，我服从
Dialogue: 0,2:40:17.02,2:40:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,2:40:25.22,2:40:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,2:40:27.34,2:40:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:40:42.98,2:40:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这个啊，能让你变得超敏感
Dialogue: 0,2:40:49.30,2:40:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是媚药精油
Dialogue: 0,2:40:56.14,2:40:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,声音真好听
Dialogue: 0,2:41:10.21,2:41:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有感觉了？
Dialogue: 0,2:41:25.10,2:41:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,想和你一起变得乱七八糟
Dialogue: 0,2:41:40.20,2:41:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也涂在我的胸上
Dialogue: 0,2:41:50.94,2:41:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,涂满它
Dialogue: 0,2:41:54.74,2:41:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一起爽起来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:42:01.02,2:42:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来，舔吧
Dialogue: 0,2:42:05.88,2:42:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,2:42:13.42,2:42:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,超舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:42:25.20,2:42:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉身体变得好热
Dialogue: 0,2:42:30.76,2:42:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢
Dialogue: 0,2:42:31.98,2:42:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好热
Dialogue: 0,2:42:34.30,2:42:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是一直在跳动
Dialogue: 0,2:42:55.08,2:42:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,变得好大了
Dialogue: 0,2:43:11.30,2:43:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,请别自己弄
Dialogue: 0,2:43:33.22,2:43:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看得见吧
Dialogue: 0,2:43:41.14,2:43:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,用你嘴上的精油，来舔我的下面
Dialogue: 0,2:44:01.01,2:44:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你可不仅仅是普通的下属
Dialogue: 0,2:44:25.58,2:44:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,用你的手指，插进来试试
Dialogue: 0,2:44:36.80,2:44:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:44:45.64,2:44:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,里面变成什么样了
Dialogue: 0,2:44:49.50,2:44:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,超湿滑
Dialogue: 0,2:44:51.81,2:44:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,里面很热吧
Dialogue: 0,2:44:56.00,2:44:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想一起变得更舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:45:07.30,2:45:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:45:10.62,2:45:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:45:15.04,2:45:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是我调教出来的下属
Dialogue: 0,2:45:43.46,2:45:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,超棒
Dialogue: 0,2:45:46.72,2:45:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:45:49.40,2:45:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了要去了
Dialogue: 0,2:45:59.58,2:46:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,2:46:07.24,2:46:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,已经湿透了
Dialogue: 0,2:46:14.08,2:46:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,才稍微碰一下就抽搐成这样
Dialogue: 0,2:46:18.99,2:46:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:46:22.16,2:46:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这个反应真的太棒
Dialogue: 0,2:46:39.18,2:46:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:46:43.14,2:46:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:46:44.62,2:47:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你的弱点，我全都知道
Dialogue: 0,2:47:13.66,2:47:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:47:34.34,2:47:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你的龟头超敏感的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:47:37.46,2:47:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你啊
Dialogue: 0,2:47:39.20,2:47:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这龟头超敏感
Dialogue: 0,2:47:45.22,2:47:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:47:50.70,2:47:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,更舒服了
Dialogue: 0,2:47:56.72,2:47:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:47:58.24,2:48:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,想被弄得更泥泞不堪吗
Dialogue: 0,2:48:00.36,2:48:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想被弄得更泥泞
Dialogue: 0,2:48:04.72,2:48:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:48:20.84,2:48:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了、不行了不行了…
Dialogue: 0,2:48:24.75,2:48:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,2:48:30.88,2:48:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,得再慢慢来才行
Dialogue: 0,2:48:53.38,2:48:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我来替你管理
Dialogue: 0,2:49:02.98,2:49:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,2:49:05.46,2:49:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,别硬撑了
Dialogue: 0,2:49:11.02,2:49:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,2:49:13.40,2:49:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,2:49:23.22,2:49:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,2:49:37.26,2:49:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种状态下射了，就没法射进我的里面了
Dialogue: 0,2:49:51.42,2:49:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:49:55.44,2:49:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这可是假的哦
Dialogue: 0,2:50:24.60,2:50:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定能忍住的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:50:31.44,2:50:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,给我忍住
Dialogue: 0,2:50:46.38,2:50:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,忍住
Dialogue: 0,2:50:58.28,2:51:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好险，差点就在这种状态下射了
Dialogue: 0,2:51:24.70,2:51:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,能忍住吗
Dialogue: 0,2:51:46.60,2:51:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还没完，还不许射
Dialogue: 0,2:52:08.42,2:52:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,给我忍住
Dialogue: 0,2:52:28.26,2:52:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,忍得很好
Dialogue: 0,2:52:42.30,2:52:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得接下来会有什么奖励
Dialogue: 0,2:52:48.96,2:52:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可以插进去了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:52:51.65,2:52:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还不让插
Dialogue: 0,2:53:01.40,2:53:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这样如何
Dialogue: 0,2:53:03.64,2:53:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手更让你舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:53:07.52,2:53:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,用手也好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:53:20.90,2:53:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,忍住了说不定会有好事
Dialogue: 0,2:53:35.00,2:53:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,屏住呼吸忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,2:53:41.88,2:53:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多到极限了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:53:51.72,2:53:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,屏住呼吸
Dialogue: 0,2:53:54.52,2:53:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还不许射
Dialogue: 0,2:53:58.44,2:54:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不过真了不起
Dialogue: 0,2:54:00.22,2:54:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,居然忍住了
Dialogue: 0,2:54:07.10,2:54:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,作为奖励，就让你插进我的里面吧
Dialogue: 0,2:54:11.97,2:54:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以？
Dialogue: 0,2:54:48.30,2:54:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,让我好好舒服一下
Dialogue: 0,2:54:59.14,2:55:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我最疼爱你了
Dialogue: 0,2:55:05.78,2:55:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你舒服的
Dialogue: 0,2:55:08.48,2:55:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,再用点力也可以
Dialogue: 0,2:55:28.84,2:55:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,屏住呼吸
Dialogue: 0,2:55:49.04,2:55:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,2:55:50.32,2:55:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:55:58.82,2:56:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这样怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:56:02.14,2:56:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:56:03.66,2:56:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,里面转着圈磨蹭的感觉呢
Dialogue: 0,2:56:05.95,2:56:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:56:17.50,2:56:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了，好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:56:46.80,2:56:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,给我憋住
Dialogue: 0,2:56:55.94,2:56:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看着插进去的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:57:01.58,2:57:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看得见吧
Dialogue: 0,2:57:06.14,2:57:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一直看着
Dialogue: 0,2:57:12.76,2:57:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,超舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:57:18.48,2:57:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:57:21.56,2:57:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的里面很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,2:57:30.98,2:57:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,给我好好看着
Dialogue: 0,2:57:54.58,2:57:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看得见吗
Dialogue: 0,2:57:58.10,2:58:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我高潮的样子你好好看清楚了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:58:03.48,2:58:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真乖
Dialogue: 0,2:58:08.44,2:58:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,2:58:14.40,2:58:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,会让你变得更加变态的
Dialogue: 0,2:58:30.24,2:58:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,叫得再大声点也可以
Dialogue: 0,2:58:37.06,2:58:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,把一切都释放出来
Dialogue: 0,2:58:51.94,2:58:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可以叫大声点
Dialogue: 0,2:59:04.02,2:59:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还不许射
Dialogue: 0,2:59:07.20,2:59:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在我说可以之前绝对不许射
Dialogue: 0,2:59:10.22,2:59:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,听懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:59:16.38,2:59:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,来，看着我高潮的样子
Dialogue: 0,2:59:21.66,2:59:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去了
Dialogue: 0,2:59:35.90,2:59:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有好好看着吗
Dialogue: 0,2:59:40.28,2:59:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那么接下来呢
Dialogue: 0,2:59:47.38,2:59:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这样如何
Dialogue: 0,2:59:58.44,3:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,看得见吗
Dialogue: 0,3:00:07.50,3:00:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,给我好好看着
Dialogue: 0,3:00:15.82,3:00:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你很喜欢我的屁股吧
Dialogue: 0,3:00:18.69,3:00:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢屁股
Dialogue: 0,3:00:24.42,3:00:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,3:00:27.62,3:00:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了？
Dialogue: 0,3:00:33.72,3:00:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,行吗
Dialogue: 0,3:00:51.42,3:00:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我动得再快一点
Dialogue: 0,3:01:04.38,3:01:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,3:01:09.06,3:01:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,给我忍住射精的冲动
Dialogue: 0,3:01:16.28,3:01:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,忍到极限的话，会变得超级舒服
Dialogue: 0,3:01:30.22,3:01:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了？
Dialogue: 0,3:01:36.10,3:01:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让你射出来吧
Dialogue: 0,3:01:52.98,3:01:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,3:01:57.16,3:02:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,来，在上司的里面射满你的精液
Dialogue: 0,3:02:04.90,3:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,把精液全都喷出来吧
Dialogue: 0,3:02:13.54,3:02:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,3:02:19.44,3:02:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了、受不了了
Dialogue: 0,3:02:20.77,3:02:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来
Dialogue: 0,3:02:47.12,3:02:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在一突一突地跳呢
Dialogue: 0,3:03:00.24,3:03:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看见了吧
Dialogue: 0,3:03:05.22,3:03:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,射了超多出来呢
Dialogue: 0,3:03:28.20,3:03:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,插进我的里面
Dialogue: 0,3:03:31.50,3:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,把那湿滑的精液多多涂抹进去
Dialogue: 0,3:03:31.50,3:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,把那湿滑的精液多多涂抹进去
Dialogue: 0,3:03:45.44,3:03:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,3:03:53.40,3:03:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,变得更满脑子都是肉棒吧
Dialogue: 0,3:04:01.64,3:04:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,表情真不错
Dialogue: 0,3:04:04.92,3:04:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,变得更笨蛋一点，全都释放出来
Dialogue: 0,3:04:30.00,3:04:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,超级舒服
Dialogue: 0,3:04:34.66,3:04:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,太爽了
Dialogue: 0,3:04:36.87,3:04:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,3:04:51.80,3:04:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都太棒了
Dialogue: 0,3:05:04.30,3:05:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:05:07.16,3:05:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,3:05:12.10,3:05:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,3:05:21.82,3:05:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,3:06:08.68,3:06:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,想变得更舒服
Dialogue: 0,3:06:11.21,3:06:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,3:06:43.50,3:06:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,让我变得更舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,3:07:03.66,3:07:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,给我过来
Dialogue: 0,3:07:13.08,3:07:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不用再忍了
Dialogue: 0,3:07:21.16,3:07:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我要爽死了
Dialogue: 0,3:07:26.30,3:07:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服得快发疯了
Dialogue: 0,3:07:39.04,3:07:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,3:07:43.74,3:07:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来也可以
Dialogue: 0,3:07:49.90,3:07:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,给我射
Dialogue: 0,3:07:55.86,3:07:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还没完
Dialogue: 0,3:07:56.68,3:07:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,给我射出来
Dialogue: 0,3:08:07.70,3:08:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来了
Dialogue: 0,3:08:11.72,3:08:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,3:08:25.14,3:08:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在看吗
Dialogue: 0,3:08:32.52,3:08:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好多精液都溢出来了
Dialogue: 0,3:08:42.50,3:08:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这还没完
Dialogue: 0,3:08:43.88,3:08:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,3:08:47.20,3:08:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,老规矩
Dialogue: 0,3:08:48.78,3:08:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的吧
Dialogue: 0,3:09:44.94,3:09:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,全都露出来给我看
Dialogue: 0,3:09:55.04,3:09:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,3:10:00.22,3:10:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,3:10:02.98,3:10:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把剩下的全都尿出来
Dialogue: 0,3:10:05.11,3:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,3:10:14.62,3:10:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,射得很棒
Dialogue: 0,3:10:22.96,3:10:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,今天作为奖励
Dialogue: 0,3:10:30.26,3:10:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把尿淋在你身上吧
Dialogue: 0,3:10:43.24,3:10:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢前辈
